==Battleground==
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[THE METAL SLOTH]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*8 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Almost the same as Heavenly Tower's [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 14|Floor 14]], except with THE METAL SLOTHS and HaterBaas, along with the other enemies aside from Metal Doge being twice as strong. The general strategy still applies here, bring [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metals]] and cats that can perform [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hits]], and this stage shouldn't be too hard if your luck is decent.

